  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Env remediation Pancevo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Milj&#xf6;sanering Pancevo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the Kosovo conflict the Pancevo Industrial Complex, composed of an oil refinery, a petrochemical plant and a fertiliser plant, was targeted by NATO air strikes and various hazardous substances were released into the environment.The programme aims to clean-up the hot-spots at the complex. Sida assistance will go to pretreatment facility, wastewater treatment plant and wastewater canal.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Under Kosovo konflikten bombades industrikomplexet i Pancevo, vilket best&#xe5;r av ett oljeraffinaderi, en petrokemisk industri och en konstg&#xf6;dselfabrik. Programme syftar till att &#xe5;terst&#xe4;lla vissa krigsskador med mycket stor milj&#xf6;p&#xe5;verkan. Sida st&#xf6;d skall anv&#xe4;ndas till &#xe5;terst&#xe4;llande av f&#xf6;rbehandlingsstation vid raffinaderiet, reningsverk och rensning av avloppskanal.</narrative>
  </description>
